Java Collection Framework
-------------------------

Java Collection Framework provides a set of classes and interfaces that are used to
store and manipulate group of objects efficiently.

It provides a ready made data structures like List, Set, Queue & Map
making data storage , retrieval easier and more efficient.

Map is NOT part of the Collection interface. It is a separate interface in the Java Collections Framework.

